ion_lane":["venue"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to visit Winter Park?","a":"**Best time:** deep winter — the core season aligns with the ski-train window (**~19 Dec 2025 – 29 Mar 2026** as a proxy; confirm the resort''s exact open/close); powder heart Jan–Mar.","source":"https://media.amtrak.com/2025/11/winter-park-express-continues-its-success-for-winter-2025-26-kicks-off-on-december-19/","accessed":"2026-07-18"},{"q":"How do I get to Winter Park?","a":"**The Winter Park Express ski train:** an Amtrak service from **Denver Union Station** to a **ski-in platform** at the resort base (via the Moffat Tunnel), resumed 2017 — for winter 2025-26, **57 round trips** (holiday runs Dec 19–21 / 26–28 / Jan 2–4, then Thu–Sun 8 Jan–29 Mar 2026), outbound Denver 7:00 a.m. arriving 9:11 a.m.","source":"https://media.amtrak.com/2025/11/winter-park-express-continues-its-success-for-winter-2025-26-kicks-off-on-december-19/","accessed":"2026-07-18"},{"q":"What is worth doing in Winter Park?","a":"**Ride the ski train to the Mary Jane bumps.** WHY: arrive by Amtrak at a ski-in platform, then ski the mythic ungroomed moguls, steeps and trees of Mary Jane — the deep-snow mountain serious Colorado skiers come for, car-free from Denver. Bookable: train + pass + ski school. **TIER: comfort→premier · Ikon/dynamic ticket; package + train far better value.** `[when: ski Dec–Apr; ski-train Thu–Sun + holidays]` DMC/ski-op 10–15% (embedded-capable). draw_rank 1.","source":"https://media.amtrak.com/2025/11/winter-park-express-continues-its-success-for-winter-2025-26-kicks-off-on-december-19/","accessed":"2026-07-18"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Winter Park Ski Guide: Denver''s Closest Big Mountain, Mary Jane & the Ski Train","meta_description":"Plan Winter Park, Colorado - Denver''s closest major ski resort on the Ikon Pass: seven territories including the legendary Mary Jane moguls, the Amtrak Winter Park Express ski train from Denver, th